{
  "_doc": "One term per concept and language (node test/terms.js checks it). forbidden: other words for the same concept, regexes (case-insensitive), allowed only in the texts under 'explain' (where the bill's words are named once). Deprecated drivers (dap, dap15, dapg) are not checked. ignore: texts about another concept (the purchase price of a battery). sv 'uttag' is also a power socket: only the grid uses are listed.",
